The current members of our nominating and corporate governance committee are Eric He, who acts as the chairman of our
nominating and corporate governance committee, and David K. Chao. Our board of directors has determined that all members of our
nominating and corporate governance committee are “independent directors”within the meaning of NASDAQ Stock Market
Rule 5605(a)(2) and meets the criteria for independence set forth in Section 10A(m)(3)(B)(i) of the Exchange Act.
Our nominating and corporate governance committee is responsible for, among other things:
(cid:120) identifying and recommending to the board nominees for election or re-election to the board, or for appointment to fill any
vacancy;
